        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Word Chain Solo or with a Friend!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect words that match the illustrations shown on the panels to create a word chain! Since there might be multiple words to describe each illustration, unexpected connections could emerge...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only can you play word chain by yourself, but you can also enjoy a versus mode with two players! Try to read your opponent's mind as you flip through the panels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip through as many panels as you can within the time limit and aim for a top ranking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/a76dfe45fe807bca37eaa0cd3631abb1.avif?t=1760435636\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras_big/a76dfe45fe807bca37eaa0cd3631abb1.avif?t=1760435636 width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet &quot;Laby&quot; - Your Word Chain Buddy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your word chain companion is Laby, a squishy yellow robot who came from somewhere unknown. Laby is very knowledgeable and will teach you all sorts of words!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/348c24b4aa112efc5bca9172ee41ead3.avif?t=1760435636\" width=384 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Lots of New Words Through Word Chain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the &quot;Picture Dictionary,&quot; you can review all the illustrations and words you've uncovered from previous panels! The more words you collect, the easier it will become to make word chain connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/cc58844f3982ddc2e0db146213623734.avif?t=1760435636\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras_big/cc58844f3982ddc2e0db146213623734.avif?t=1760435636 width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friend Features (Coming Soon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend feature is planned for a future update. Compete with your friends and compare word chain scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/cc33e82efa5f356873e67c261868bf2c.avif?t=1760435636\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras_big/cc33e82efa5f356873e67c261868bf2c.avif?t=1760435636 width=1170 height=658 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Word Chain Solo or with a Friend!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect words that match the illustrations shown on the panels to create a word chain! Since there might be multiple words to describe each illustration, unexpected connections could emerge...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only can you play word chain by yourself, but you can also enjoy a versus mode with two players! Try to read your opponent's mind as you flip through the panels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip through as many panels as you can within the time limit and aim for a top ranking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/a76dfe45fe807bca37eaa0cd3631abb1.avif?t=1760435636\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras_big/a76dfe45fe807bca37eaa0cd3631abb1.avif?t=1760435636 width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet &quot;Laby&quot; - Your Word Chain Buddy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your word chain companion is Laby, a squishy yellow robot who came from somewhere unknown. Laby is very knowledgeable and will teach you all sorts of words!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/348c24b4aa112efc5bca9172ee41ead3.avif?t=1760435636\" width=384 height=384 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Lots of New Words Through Word Chain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the &quot;Picture Dictionary,&quot; you can review all the illustrations and words you've uncovered from previous panels! The more words you collect, the easier it will become to make word chain connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/cc58844f3982ddc2e0db146213623734.avif?t=1760435636\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras_big/cc58844f3982ddc2e0db146213623734.avif?t=1760435636 width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friend Features (Coming Soon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend feature is planned for a future update. Compete with your friends and compare word chain scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras/cc33e82efa5f356873e67c261868bf2c.avif?t=1760435636\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385250/extras_big/cc33e82efa5f356873e67c261868bf2c.avif?t=1760435636 width=1170 height=658 /></span></p>",
